{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04078","headline":"奉和圣制幸望春宫送[朔方]大总管张仁亶 · 苏頲","name":"奉和圣制幸望春宫送[朔方]大总管张仁亶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北风吹早雁，日夕渡河飞。\n气冷胶应折，霜明草正腓。\n老臣帷幄筭，元宰庙堂机。\n饯饮廻仙跸，临戎解御衣。\n军装乘晓发，师律候春归。\n方伫勳庸盛，天词降紫微。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04078.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04078","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}